# A bound narrowed between source and target: {a: 50} is a valid source instance the target rejects (#20).
-- source.cue --
a!: int
-- target.cue --
a!: int & <10
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {a: v0_0.a}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.a copies v0_0.a, which is now int & <10, which does not accept every value of the prior int (compat rule value-narrowed) (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:11
